{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 MIDI Velocity EQ (for Gabri)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 A sort of MIDI EQ that selectively applies percentages of a custom velocity curve to incoming notes, plus an Offset EQ that can be routed pre- or post-calculation. Developed through vibe-coding (AI-assisted). {\i Dedicato a mia mamma Gabriella per il suo 83\u176 ? compleanno}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Mini-Guide\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Double-click grid:} Add custom point\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Single-click piano:} Add custom point\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Drag point:} Reposition freely\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Arrow keys:} Fine-tuning nudge\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Shift+drag:} Snap to grid\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Ctrl+drag:} Lock horizontal axis\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Alt+drag segment:} Adjust curvature\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Right-click point/curve:} Delete/Reset\sa180\par}
